"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"HT9bRxgQ8IY2vfTn"},{"type":"action","name":"Speak with Wasps","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>A rothive can communicate with wasps and use Diplomacy to @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.actions.Item.OX4fy22hQgUHDr0q]{Make an Impression} on wasps and Request things from wasps.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"d8rzDlqDli7A0wFG","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Consume Swarm","system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> a rothive is reduced to 0 Hit Points and a wasp swarm is within 40 feet</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> the rothive releases a pheromone that calls the wasp swarm to reinforce their crumbling body. The wasp swarm uses its reaction to fly into the rothive, destroying itself and transferring all its remaining Hit Points to the rothive. Wasp swarms whose Intelligence modifier is greater than –5 can attempt a @Check[will|dc:18] save to resist the effect; when used against such swarms, the effect gains the incapacitation trait.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["healing","olfactory","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"kTDV5jjzSBmEOtsQ","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Disorienting Drone","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>10 feet. The hum of wings from within the rothive bends the minds of those who come too close. All creatures within the aura must attempt a @Check[will|dc:18] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is temporarily immune to Disorienting Drone for 24 hours.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} until the end of its next turn.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2} until the end of its next turn.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"Aura","traits":["auditory","emotion","mental","primal"],"effects":[],"radius":10}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","aura","emotion","mental","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"xpwc9QUGWaTF5UyS","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Smokesleep","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>Whenever a rothive begins their turn or enters a space where there is enough smoke to grant the @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed} condition, the rothive must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:25] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Success</strong> The rothive is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1}.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The rothive is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 2}.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The rothive is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 3} and becomes indifferent to all other creatures for 1 minute. During this time, the rothive's attitude can worsen toward a creature only if that creature takes a hostile action against them.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["air","olfactory"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"ziyELzu4HyjhgdQR","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Corpse Honey","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:18]</p><p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p><p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1} (1 round)</p><p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2} (1 round)</p><p><strong>Stage 3</strong> sickened 2 and the creature can't reduce its sickened value below 1 (1 r